A Clock Group timing constraint is set between synchronous clocks clk25 and clk6p25 (see constraint position 4 in the Timing Constraint window in Vivado IDE). Masking entire synchronous clock domains via  set_false_path, set_clock_groups or set_max_delay -datapath_only may result in failure in hardware.
